---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <nav class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 md:px-10">
    <a href="/" class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center bg-fg" aria-label="Oyster Genomics">
      <span class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-bg">OG</span>
    </a>
  </nav>
  <main class="px-6 pb-16 md:px-10 md:pb-24">
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      The ocean feeds billions. We’re upgrading the operating system.
    </h1>
    <div class="manifesto">
      <p>
        Land agriculture figured this out decades ago: giant monopolies weren’t built on better
        tractors—they were built on owning the code. From Monsanto to Ohalo Genetics bypassing
        millions of years of plant evolution, terrestrial ag has spent fifty years engineering
        massive, compounding yield gains.
      </p>
      <p>
        Meanwhile, aquaculture—the fastest-growing animal protein sector on earth—is still largely
        farming wild genetics and hoping for calm seas.
      </p>
      <p>That changes with OG.</p>
      <p>
        We aren't just running damage control on coastal die-offs. Our Switchpoint platform treats
        the marine genome as programmable architecture—merging precision editing, multi-omics, and
        machine learning to compress biological growth timelines, erase disease vulnerabilities, and
        double down on biomass accumulation.
      </p>
      <p>Fewer resources. Fractions of the harvest cycle. Unstoppable yields.</p>
      <p>We cracked the code for marine protein. The ocean is just our canvas.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer px-6 md:px-10">
    <a href="mailto:jeff@oystergenomics.com" aria-label="Email Jeff at Oyster Genomics">
      Contact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </footer>
</Base>
